{"id":"nc599a5ba1e","headline":"Optimizely Hack Affects 178 Organizations","summary":"A cyberattack on Optimizely distributed malicious code to websites of 178 organisations, including HSBC, Zoom, BBC, CNN and IKEA. The platform said it fixed the vulnerability and removed the code.","why":"Optimizely is a website experimentation and content software vendor, so breaches at such platforms can expose the customers that use them.","category":"technology","event_type":"other","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"San Francisco","country":"United States of America","lat":37.775,"lon":-122.419,"region":"na"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"El Economista","url":"https://www.eleconomista.com.mx/videos/hackeo-optimizely-afecta-178-organizaciones-20261117-844448.html"},"sources":[{"name":"El Economista","url":"https://www.eleconomista.com.mx/videos/hackeo-optimizely-afecta-178-organizaciones-20261117-844448.html"}],"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:07:30Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-18T02:38:30Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"score":0,"content_hash":"306c79bb13d4a860","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-18T02:38:30Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"regional-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-11-18T00:07:30Z","feed_url":"https://www.eleconomista.com.mx/rss/ultimas-noticias"},"original_headline":"Hackeo Optimizely afecta a 178 organizaciones","headline_translated":true}